## Article 20. Deadline for reviewing citizens' appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article20AppealReviewDeadline:
  input appealType content AppealType
  input requiresAdditionalStudy content YesNo
  input privilegesApplicable content YesNo
  input writtenShorteningRequest content YesNo
  input appealFiledDate content date
  input currentDate content date
  output maxReviewDays content integer
  output urgentReviewRequired content YesNo
  output extendedDeadlineAllowed content YesNo
  output maxExtendedDays content integer
  output shorteningPossible content YesNo
  output deadlineExceeded content YesNo

scope Article20AppealReviewDeadline:
  label max_review_days_exception default_month
  definition maxReviewDays under condition
    requiresAdditionalStudy = Yes
    consequence equals 30

  label default_month
  definition maxReviewDays equals 15

  label urgent_exception default_not_urgent
  definition urgentReviewRequired under condition
    privilegesApplicable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_urgent
  definition urgentReviewRequired equals No

  label extended_exception default_not_extended
  definition extendedDeadlineAllowed under condition
    requiresAdditionalStudy = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_extended
  definition extendedDeadlineAllowed equals No

  label max_extended_exception default_max_normal
  definition maxExtendedDays under condition
    extendedDeadlineAllowed = Yes
    consequence equals 45

  label default_max_normal
  definition maxExtendedDays equals 30

  label shortening_exception default_not_shortening
  definition shorteningPossible under condition
    writtenShorteningRequest = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_not_shortening
  definition shorteningPossible equals No

  label deadline_exceeded_exception default_not_exceeded
  definition deadlineExceeded under condition
    currentDate <> Date.year_month_day 1970 1 1
    consequence equals No

  label default_not_exceeded
  definition deadlineExceeded equals No
```
